import Page from '@/layouts/Page.astro';
import { owner as o } from '@/lib/legal';
---
<Page lang="en" title="Privacy" description="Privacy policy of Die Neue – Christian Helmbrecht, Munich." lede="Short version: this site sets no cookies, uses no analytics tools and loads nothing from Google, Meta or other ad networks. What is stored is listed here.">
  <h2>1. Controller</h2>
  <p>{o.name}, {o.street}, {o.city}, Germany, phone {o.phone}, email <a href={`mailto:${o.email}`}>{o.email}</a>.</p>

  <h2>2. Hosting and server logs</h2>
  <p>This website is hosted on a server at DigitalOcean. When you visit, server log files are created automatically: IP address, date and time, page requested, data volume, browser and operating system, referring page. This data serves secure and stable operation (Art. 6 (1) (f) GDPR) and is deleted after 14 days at the latest. It is not combined with other data.</p>

  <h2>3. No cookies, no tracking</h2>
  <p>This website sets no cookies and uses no analytics or tracking services. Fonts are served from my own server, not from Google. That is why there is no cookie banner.</p>

  <h2>4. Embedded videos</h2>
  <p>The home page embeds videos from YouTube. Until you click “play”, only a preview image is loaded from my server and no connection to YouTube is made. Only on click does the player load from YouTube (Google Ireland Ltd., Gordon House, Barrow Street, Dublin 4, Ireland) in privacy-enhanced mode (youtube-nocookie.com). YouTube then receives your IP address and may set its own cookies. The legal basis is your consent by clicking (Art. 6 (1) (a) GDPR). Details: <a href="https://policies.google.com/privacy" rel="noopener">policies.google.com/privacy</a>.</p>

  <h2>5. Contact form and email</h2>
  <p>If you write to me via the contact form or by email, I store your details (name, email address, company if given, message) to answer your enquiry and for possible follow-up questions (Art. 6 (1) (b) GDPR, pre-contractual measures). The data is deleted once it is no longer needed for this purpose and no statutory retention obligations apply. The form is sent directly from my server to me as an email; no third-party provider is involved.</p>

  <h2>6. External links</h2>
  <p>This site links to external websites (e.g. LinkedIn, client websites). Their operators’ privacy policies apply to their data processing.</p>

  <h2>7. Your rights</h2>
  <p>You have the right to access (Art. 15 GDPR), rectification (Art. 16), erasure (Art. 17), restriction of processing (Art. 18), data portability (Art. 20) and objection (Art. 21). You can withdraw consent at any time. You can also complain to a supervisory authority; in Bavaria this is the Bayerisches Landesamt für Datenschutzaufsicht, Promenade 18, 91522 Ansbach, Germany.</p>

  <h2>8. Version</h2>
  <p>November 2026. I will update this policy if the technology changes.</p>
</Page>
